{"server":"tw","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_04_beg","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_04","title":"雪裡紅","storyCode":"OR-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4ad0996ccf25c6c01ad03d8d366b2f646f228eb9e8d0d32f785906c21c9f22ba","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"煌來到鼎豐樓參加百珍宴的廚師選拔賽，與此同時，驚蟄也來此查案。煌歪打正著地通過了層層選拔，與莫不服會面時，鼎豐樓比賽現場卻突然起火。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g15_restaurantlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禮貌的招待","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎光臨鼎豐樓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇……這就是傳說中的鼎豐樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……還緊張嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？有什麼好緊張的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上就要比賽了，可為什麼，我有種心虛的感覺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼，小大廚最後都說可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，我們又不是真的是去當廚師的，我們只是想找到那位傳奇大廚，親口問問他那種桔紅酥的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，也只能這麼說服自己了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間差不多了。觀賽的客官請在這裡留步，參賽的廚師請隨我上前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遇到難題的時候，千萬別衝動，冷靜思考，總有辦法的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我去啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說您今天是來參加考試的，但遠來是客，還請先用一杯茶。"},{"type":"narration","text":"考官端起桌上的茶壺，為煌倒上茶水，清甜的香味頓時盈滿鼻腔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是比賽，這氛圍還蠻友好的嘛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好路上口渴，多謝啦！"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌拿起茶盞，仰頭滿飲。\n緊接著，考官將紙筆放在她的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這壺茶中泡了幾味料，寫下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳……什麼？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌看向自己的茶盞，僅剩的一點水珠掛在杯壁上。煌又抬起頭看向了眼前的考官，他的臉上依然掛著一副禮貌的微笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還能……再來一杯嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠閒的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看今天應該是沒希望啦，從上午到現在來了幾十號人，到現在這第一關都沒人能過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無聊的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總廚出題也太刁鑽了，考試的人一進門就是這樣一齣，換誰來都會傻掉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠閒的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舌頭就是廚師的眼睛，要是舌頭上的功夫不過關，廚藝也高不到哪裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠閒的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連這一關都過不了，那也不用浪費總廚時間了，還是叫他們早些打道回府的好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠閒的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸客人，這裡可是廚房。你怎麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺查案，煩請各位配合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g15_restaurantlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜……冷靜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mechanist說過，人的舌頭只能嚐出四種味道，但是鼻子可以分辨出上百種味道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也沒有從他的“機油”酒中聞出過什麼味就是了……"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌小心翼翼地端起已經沒那麼燙的茶盞，仔細嗅聞著杯中餘味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能聞到花香，應該是茉莉花的味道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不只是茉莉花，還有一種……對，是菊花！小大廚飯館裡待客的菊花茶就是這種味道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了花香，茶水喝下去的時候，我記得明明有一點酸甜味……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的料都不帶酸，那最後的那點味道到底是什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個酸酸甜甜的味道，好像有點熟悉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g2_downtownarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要帶我來喝這個梅子酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這梅子酒，其實也算百灶的一樣特色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在百灶城北方，有一大片梅林。每年六月初夏，新鮮的梅子成熟的時候，人們會採下許多拿來泡酒，最好是用小寒酒來泡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……這種苔麥釀成的酒，有種特殊的香味，搭配梅子正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泡製三個月左右的時間，到中秋就剛好能喝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅子酒……也有什麼歷史嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才不是問我……那些百灶建城時犧牲的人，後來都怎樣了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實也算不上什麼歷史，我只是想起，在過去條件艱苦的時候，梅乾是工人們常吃的一種食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在百灶城建好後，不知哪一年起，城北的山上，就有了這樣一片梅林。不知是何時，也不知是誰種下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也算是……一種紀念？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，他們從來沒有被忘記……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，等明年梅子熟的時候，我可以帶你去山上看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g15_restaurantlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這是我的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉花、野菊、青梅、天岳春、冰糖……小寒酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，百灶的北面有片梅林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六月採的梅子做酒，釀到中秋剛好。這裡用的梅子應該是早前採的，所以酸澀味還沒完全去掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒氣在煮茶時消散，所以只剩下梅子的酸甜口感，再加上使用的花朵本身溫和的口感和淡香……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然剛入口時並不明顯，但回味讓人印象深刻……還想再來一杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能嚐出前幾味材料應該是情理之中，但是能嚐出這是用了小寒酒的，你還是今天頭一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……說對了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道對自己給出的答案沒有自信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒！沒有！當然不是……哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那恭喜你通過第一關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請隨我上樓。"},{"type":"narration","text":"後堂傳來一聲擊鑼聲，煌身旁的大門緩緩打開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一關……？還有幾關啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人……這是您要的，鼎豐樓廚師的名錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能麻煩問問，您到底是來查什麼的……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……大理寺重要密案，暫時不方便告知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的總廚，名字叫莫不服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，莫大廚的名號，整個百灶廚界誰人不知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，在來到鼎豐樓以前，莫不服做的是什麼工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我可就不知道了……莫大廚來鼎豐樓也就不到十年的時間，說長不長說短不短，但他的廚藝確實出神入化，很快就接了老總廚的班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在在哪裡？我需要見他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在不好意思，總廚他現在正在主持考試，實在不方便見您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考試？什麼考試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就當是鼎豐樓的招生考試？好幾年才舉辦一屆的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼎豐樓廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要是感興趣的話，這裡也能看到轉播哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這參賽的人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不是酒樓嗎……為什麼這個房間好像書房？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼎豐樓數百年歷史，接待過無數名士大家，鼎豐樓特意留了這樣一間書房，來保存他們的墨寶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珍饈書畫，都是瑰寶，都見功夫。"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌仰頭望去，房頂垂下千百根絲線，每根絲線都繫著一塊木牌，似一張帷幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這上面寫的，都是菜名……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該知道，鼎豐樓如今招納廚師，是為了百珍宴做準備。這要求廚師不只有廚藝，也得瞭解自己做的菜品的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掛在這裡的，都是歷屆百珍宴上有來頭的菜品。你抽一塊木牌，說出這道菜的來歷，便是今天的第二關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（百珍宴的菜？我哪知道？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（都到這一步了——）"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌閉上眼睛，猛地抽下一塊木牌。臨近的木牌互相牽動，發出連綿的碰撞聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“天下一白”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g15_restaurantlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐基本沒有什麼煮飯的知識，能闖過第一關已經是僥倖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她從小在維多利亞長大，怎麼可能知道這些故事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐……這我可幫不了你啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴厲的考官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間有限。這道菜的出處，你知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概五十年前，炎國的太師向真龍獻上了一道菜，是一道再簡單不過的清燉蘿蔔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但特殊之處在於，這道菜用到的蘿蔔來自天南地北，本身的味道口感相差巨大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是蘿蔔經過長時間燉煮，吸足了湯汁，吃到嘴裡，都是一樣好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，炎國向來十分重視教育，可炎國太大，各個城市的環境也是天差地別，越是偏遠的地區，學生越難有所成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位太師是想告訴真龍，天下學子，不論出身，都該有平等的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真龍聽取了太師的建議，著力支持教育改革，努力打破了辦學講學在地域上的限制，平均分配教育資源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二年，百灶學宮發榜，錄取的一千多人裡，偏遠地區出身的學子有一半多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往後的幾十年裡，天師府深造的天師、學宮中寒窗苦讀的學子，都十分感謝當年太師的直言進諫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這應該，就是這道“天下一白”的含義……"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌話音剛落，她感到觀眾席的交談聲頓時小了下來。\n事實上，她的感覺並沒有錯，所有人都在盯著她，神色緊張。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g15_restaurantlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（煌小姐……為什麼知道這件事？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這裡的出題人，怎麼還會留著這道菜……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那個人，可不是能當眾提起的啊……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說錯了什麼嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有意思。"},{"type":"narration","text":"聲音自幾丈高之處落下，煌抬頭望去，卻不見人影。\n腳步踩在樓梯的木板上，發出一陣悶響，它沉穩有力，讓人無法忽略。\n聲音越來越近，煌終於勉強能看清來者——嚴肅的長者從長階上緩緩走下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到過了這麼多年，還有人記得這事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你講的這個故事，年紀可比你大，姑娘，你是怎麼知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是很久以前，我的家人跟我講過的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人說，他就是當年那無數寒門學子之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"飲水思源，想來你的家人也是一個重情重義的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是懷著什麼心思來到這裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……當然是……準備認真參加比賽的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經站到了這裡，那我就給你一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一關，堂堂正正地，做一道“菜”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"narration","text":"還不到飯點，飯館裡只零星坐著幾個客人，卻不見跑堂與老闆，廚房也是一片寂靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的食客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這位兄弟！幫幫忙吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的食客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天出門實在著急，忘了帶飯錢。這位兄弟一看就是大家公子，行行好，借我一點錢吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的食客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不白拿你的，喏，這塊家傳寶玉先抵在你這。等我回頭拿了錢再找你贖回它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借給您倒也無妨……可是您既然有這樣的麻煩，直接和這裡的老闆說明不就好了嗎……？我們素不相識，您又怎麼把錢還我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的食客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不一樣不一樣，這塊寶玉可不是凡物，不是交到誰手裡都行的。我是見公子氣度不凡，這才委託您保管一下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……好吧……"},{"type":"narration","text":"左樂從口袋裡掏出一點零錢交給食客，食客拿到了錢，立刻喜上眉梢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您打算何時把錢還給我……？我們要約在哪裡見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的食客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有緣則見，無緣就不見。要是無緣，公子拿這塊玉典當換錢就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的食客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心放心，這筆生意，公子不會虧的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"話音未落，食客一溜煙地跑出了飯館，消失在人群裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典當……換錢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我準備的菜，品相不錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……長壽麵？"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫不服的手落在案上，遲遲沒有動筷。他沉默了許久，才拿起勺子，嚐了一口湯。\n煌小心地觀察著莫大廚，可她期待的那種滿意的神情遲遲沒有在老人臉上出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這碗麵……這個湯底，是誰教你做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個小不點廚師教的。為了學會怎麼做可是花了我不少功夫呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“餘味居”的老闆，是你什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……欺人太甚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看他有些天分，想給他一個機會大展身手。可他不領情也就罷了，現在還要派一個半吊子來羞辱我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g15_restaurantlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌明明很順利地完成了……味道按理說不會差才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……莫不服，難道認識小大廚？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！你先等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！我知道你肯定一眼就能看出我根本不會煮飯，我也不是故意來你的比賽上搗亂的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是有個問題，我必須向你請教！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小生活在維多利亞，那時我遠在炎國的家人經常會寄一種桔紅酥給我。味道很甜，很好吃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來百灶後找了很久，但一直沒有找到那種味道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，你是全百灶最好的廚師，你也許會知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是一味點心？這個問題值得你專門參加比賽來找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有很多問題！但現在靠我一個人，只能解決這一個。這是我唯一能接觸到的與我家人有關的線索了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……做桔紅酥最忌諱的就是一味加糖，用甜味去掩蓋手藝不精和用料不佳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不知道誰有那麼大的本事，能把桔紅酥做得又甜又好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要問的問題問完了，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人的正上方響起沉悶的聲音，煌和莫不服抬頭看去，臉龐卻被什麼東西打濕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡怎麼會漏水……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對……是油！"},{"type":"narration","text":"話音剛落，穹頂懸掛的吊燈瞬間燃起，化成一個火球——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快躲開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
